# Local Vercel CLI link (project id / OIDC token)
.vercel

# public/ is what `expo export` copies verbatim into dist/, and all of it is
# generated: the legal pages by `pnpm build:legal` from docs/legal/*.md, the
# HTML shell and the web manifest by `pnpm build:shell`, the Home Screen icons
# by `pnpm icons` and the link-preview card by `pnpm og`, both from the
# DheeMark geometry. Nothing in here is hand-written; the sources are.
public/

# Saved eval runs and their HTML reports (`pnpm eval`). Every run costs money
# and captures full model replies, so these are local artefacts, not history.
# Also listed in .prettierignore — Prettier does not read this file.
.evals/
